entries.source:
#VIOLET#*As you open the door you notice a huge orc in the distance, covered in both flames and ice.*#LAST#
@playerdescriptor.race@! You should never have come! Your doom awaits!
The Orc Pride will never yield to anybody! They have their precious and there is nothing you can do.

entries.target:
#VIOLET#*当你打开门，你注意到远处一个巨大的兽人，周身同时被烈焰与寒冰笼罩。*#LAST#
@playerdescriptor.race@！你根本不该来这里！你的死期到了！
兽人部落绝不会向任何人屈服！他们已经拿到了至宝，你什么也做不了。

